#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:703
msgid ""
"To create the printer share *LaserPrinter01* on the print server "
"*printserver.example.com*, run the :option:`udm create` command shown in "
":numref:`udm-create-printer-share-listing`. The PPD file defines the "
"printer properties. Specify the PPD filename relative to "
":file:`/usr/share/ppd/`. Ensure the printer is reachable over the network"
" and supports the IPP protocol."
msgstr ""
"Führen Sie den in :numref:`udm-create-printer-share-listing` gezeigten "
