msgid ":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-devices-printers`"
msgstr ":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-devices-printers`"

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:753
msgid ""
"in :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual` for information about the *Printers* "
"management module."
msgstr ""
"im :cite:t:`uv-nubus-manual` für Informationen über das Verwaltungsmodul "
"*Drucker*."

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:759
msgid "DNS and DHCP"
msgstr "DNS und DHCP"

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:761
msgid ""
"To configure an IP assignment through DHCP, register a DHCP computer "
"entry for the MAC address, as shown in :numref:`udm-create-dhcp-host-"
"listing`. For more information about DHCP, see :external+uv-ucs-"
"manual:ref:`module-dhcp-dhcp`."
msgstr ""
"Führen Sie den in :numref:`udm-create-dhcp-host-listing` gezeigten Befehl"
" aus, um eine IP-Zuweisung über DHCP zu konfigurieren und dafür einen "
"DHCP-Computereintrag für die MAC-Adresse zu registrieren. Weitere "
"Informationen über DHCP finden Sie unter :external+uv-ucs-manual:ref"
":`module-dhcp-dhcp`."

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:769
msgid "Create a DHCP host entry"
msgstr "Einen DHCP-Hosteintrag erstellen"

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:769
msgid ""
"$ univention-directory-manager dhcp/host create \\\n"
"  --superordinate \"cn=example.com,cn=dhcp,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set host=\"Client222\" \\\n"
"  --set fixedaddress=\"192.0.2.110\" \\\n"
"  --set hwaddress=\"ethernet 00:11:22:33:44:55\""
msgstr ""
"$ univention-directory-manager dhcp/host create \\\n"
"  --superordinate \"cn=example.com,cn=dhcp,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set host=\"Client222\" \\\n"
"  --set fixedaddress=\"192.0.2.110\" \\\n"
"  --set hwaddress=\"ethernet 00:11:22:33:44:55\""

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:779
msgid ""
"To resolve a computer name through DNS, use the commands shown in :numref"
":`udm-create-dns-host-record-listing` and :numref:`udm-create-dns-ptr-"
"record-listing` to configure forward resolution with a host record and "
"reverse resolution with a PTR record. For more information about DNS, see"
" :external+uv-ucs-manual:ref:`networks-dns`."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie die in :numref:`udm-create-dns-host-record-listing` und "
":numref:`udm-create-dns-ptr-record-listing` gezeigten Befehle, um einen "
"Computernamen über DNS aufzulösen und dafür die Vorwärtsauflösung mit "
"einem Rechner-Eintrag und die Rückwärtsauflösung mit einem DNS Pointer "
"Eintrag zu konfigurieren. Weitere Informationen über DNS finden Sie unter"
" :external+uv-ucs-manual:ref:`networks-dns`."

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:789
msgid "Create a DNS host record"
msgstr "Einen DNS Rechner-Eintrag erstellen"

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:789
msgid ""
"$ univention-directory-manager dns/host_record create \\\n"
"  --superordinate \"zoneName=example.com,cn=dns,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set name=\"Client222\" \\\n"
"  --set a=\"192.0.2.110\""
msgstr ""
"$ univention-directory-manager dns/host_record create \\\n"
"  --superordinate \"zoneName=example.com,cn=dns,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set name=\"Client222\" \\\n"
"  --set a=\"192.0.2.110\""

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:798
msgid "Create a DNS PTR record"
msgstr "Einen DNS Pointer Eintrag erstellen"

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:798
msgid ""
"$ univention-directory-manager dns/ptr_record create \\\n"
"  --superordinate \"zoneName=0.168.192.in-"
"addr.arpa,cn=dns,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set address=\"110\" \\\n"
"  --set ptr_record=\"Client222.example.com.\""
msgstr ""
"$ univention-directory-manager dns/ptr_record create \\\n"
"  --superordinate \"zoneName=0.168.192.in-"
"addr.arpa,cn=dns,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set address=\"110\" \\\n"
"  --set ptr_record=\"Client222.example.com.\""

