#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:820
msgid "Extended attributes"
msgstr "Erweiterte Attribute"

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:822
msgid ""
"Use extended attributes to add fields to management modules in the "
"*Management UI*. For more information, see :external+uv-nubus-manual:ref"
":`nubus-domain-extended-attributes`. To add a new attribute that stores "
"the license plate number of a company car for each user, run the "
":option:`udm create` command shown in :numref:`udm-create-extended-"
"attribute-listing`. The object class ``univentionFreeAttributes`` stores "
"these values."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie erweiterte Attribute, um Felder zu Verwaltungsmodulen in "
"der *Management UI* hinzuzufügen. Weitere Informationen finden Sie unter "
":external+uv-nubus-manual:ref:`nubus-domain-extended-attributes`. Führen "
"Sie den in :numref:`udm-create-extended-attribute-listing` gezeigten "
"Befehl :option:`udm create` aus, um ein neues Attribut hinzuzufügen, das für jeden Benutzer "
"das Kennzeichen eines Firmenwagens speichert. Die Objektklasse "
"``univentionFreeAttributes`` speichert diese Werte."

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:828
msgid "Create an extended attribute"
msgstr "Ein erweitertes Attribut erstellen"

#: ../../management-interface/udm-command.rst:828
msgid ""
"$ univention-directory-manager settings/extended_attribute create \\\n"
"  --position \"cn=custom attributes,cn=univention,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set name=\"CarLicense\" \\\n"
"  --set module=\"users/user\" \\\n"
"  --set ldapMapping=\"univentionFreeAttribute1\" \\\n"
"  --set objectClass=\"univentionFreeAttributes\" \\\n"
"  --set longDescription=\"License plate number of the company car\" \\\n"
"  --set tabName=\"Company car\" \\\n"
"  --set multivalue=0 \\\n"
"  --set syntax=\"string\" \\\n"
"  --set shortDescription=\"Car license\""
msgstr ""
"$ univention-directory-manager settings/extended_attribute create \\\n"
"  --position \"cn=custom attributes,cn=univention,dc=example,dc=com\" \\\n"
"  --set name=\"CarLicense\" \\\n"
"  --set module=\"users/user\" \\\n"
"  --set ldapMapping=\"univentionFreeAttribute1\" \\\n"
"  --set objectClass=\"univentionFreeAttributes\" \\\n"
"  --set longDescription=\"License plate number of the company car\" \\\n"
"  --set tabName=\"Company car\" \\\n"
"  --set multivalue=0 \\\n"
"  --set syntax=\"string\" \\\n"
"  --set shortDescription=\"Car license\""

